and then our group took it to a different level. So there was no script that I was privy to, but I knew the kind of general idea of it. What was it like to walk onto the set for the first time? Really weird. It's really weird. It's also then a now I'm a fan of the American version. And you start to know the set, obviously,
然后我们的团队把它提升到了一个新的水平。所以我没有看过任何剧本，但我知道它的大致想法。第一次走进片场是什么感觉？真的很奇怪。真的很奇怪。而且现在我是美国版的粉丝。你开始了解片场，显然，

